      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `select_voice.py` that lists or selects a voice for a target locale using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific provider and use its API or SDK. I will use Amazon Polly, a popular text-to-speech service, for this task. The code will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and will use the `polly` client to interact with the Amazon Polly service. </thinking>\n",
