        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize SSML with voice and prosody controls, I will use Amazon Polly, a cloud-based text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech. I will import the boto3 library to interact with the Amazon Polly API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of boto3 and the use of the polly client. </thinking>\n",
